# Docker runs the shell scripts, Dockerfiles and compose files straight from
# this checkout, and Git for Windows converts text to CRLF by default: a
# "#!/bin/sh\r" shebang cannot be exec'd, Postgres' init script fails, and
# the stack never comes up. Every text file stays LF on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
